     "excerpt": "Northwind supports retaining the 7% model test limit and the current risk-based recall approach. Halcyon’s figures reinforce that test failure rates and field incident rates may not track one another: an independent 8-per-100,000 notification and review trigger is useful, but a mandatory recall based on rate alone is not.",
