     "excerpt": "Version 26’s 7% S2 limit preserves the agreed non-public disclosure boundary and avoids putting the Hearth 10 over the limit. S5 retains the 8-per-100,000 notification and review trigger without an automatic recall. I recommend holding these terms and having the negotiator sign if the other side accepts; avoid edits that would reopen the current text.",
